                  "type": "text",
                  "text": "The kernel refutes lead ef58b583: An involution alone is barren: dz reaches exactly two states from any seed, alternating with doubling reaches all ten. The productive partner is the IRREVERSIBLE one — dz is reversible and free, doubling collapses."
                }
              ]
